sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Backend API
    participant K as Cache
    participant D as Database
    A->>K: get team T1
    alt cache hit
        K-->>A: stored copy
    else cache miss
        K-->>A: nothing found
        A->>D: read team T1
        D-->>A: current row
        A->>K: store a copy with a time to live
    end
    Note over A,D: On a write the API changes the database first, then removes the cached copy
